lab/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Recorded check timings. Generated by a full run and read by the default one to decide what to
# skip — so it changes on every machine and every run, and it conflicted on the first two
# branches that touched it. It is derived, not authored.
#
# A fresh clone has none, and the runner says so and runs everything once to make some. That is
# the right behaviour anyway: the timings should come from the machine that will use them.
lab/.check-times.json
